      "content": "wait, a walk? i feel kinda lightheaded and nauseous right now, i'm not sure if i should be moving around. and are you sure about the aspirin and ibuprofen combo? i've heard mixing those can be bad for your stomach. it just feels so different than my normal migraine though, like it literally slammed into me. you're sure it's okay to just wait and see?",
